ext-primary">From 313 trades</span></header><ul class="flex flex-col gap-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border-default pb-4 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0"><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-8 bg-surface-sunken text-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock size-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-body-strong text-text-primary">Losers run four times longer</p><p class="text-ui-caption text-text-secondary">Average loser lasts 6h 10m, average winner 1h 32m. Losers held over 4 hours lost 604.20 USD.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border-default pb-4 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0"><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-8 bg-surface-sunken text-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up size-4" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-body-strong text-text-primary">Bigger lots after a loss</p><p class="text-ui-caption text-text-secondary">14 times this trader raised lot size within an hour of a losing trade. Those trades lost 186.40 USD in total.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border-default pb-4 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0"><span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-8 bg-surface-sunken text-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" he